#: src/Pro/Tracking.php:64
msgid "Parameters: bar_name, button_label, button_action (link, phone, email, whatsapp …) and link_url for links. In Google Tag Manager, use a trigger of type \"Custom event\" with this event name. The plugin sets no cookies; consent is handled by your cookie banner as usual."
